### Auth — single admin user, httpOnly cookie session.
# REST Client keeps the cookies from login for every later request, including
# requests in the other .http files.

### Login (sets access + refresh cookies)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Current user (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Refresh access token from the refresh cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Logout (clears both cookies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
